{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想把模糊舊片或壓縮過度的素材救回來，又不想把私人檔案上傳雲端？《Video Upscaler》以裝置端人工智能修復為核心，適合整理家庭舊片、社交媒體影片或低清下載素材，最高可放大 4 倍並輸出接近 4K 的畫面。原價 US $4.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>裝置端智能修復引擎</h2>\n<p>這款 App 以裝置端人工智能神經網絡運算，將模糊、壓縮過度或低解像度的相片與影片，一鍵提升至最高 4 倍解像度。修復引擎會重建五官、皮膚紋理與髮絲細節，並去除數碼雜訊；內置實時分割預覽滑桿，匯出前可左右對比前後效果，相片與影片共用同一套流程。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-719-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-720-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-721-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-722-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-723-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Video Upscaler</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T12:19:08.434655+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}